audio_tags_taglib

This package statically links TagLib (LGPL-2.1-or-later) into the
prebuilt native binaries shipped under prebuilt/.

  TagLib © Scott Wheeler and contributors
  https://taglib.org/
  https://github.com/taglib/taglib/blob/master/COPYING.LGPL

End users distributing applications built with audio_tags_taglib must
comply with TagLib's LGPL terms — typically by linking dynamically or
by providing the relinking artefacts. The default build hook produces
a self-contained shim with TagLib statically embedded; this satisfies
LGPL section 4(d) when combined with this NOTICE file and the build
scripts (build_linux.sh, build_macos.sh, build_windows.ps1) that allow
a user to relink against an updated TagLib.
